# Admin Client — Environment Variables

# ── Development ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave empty so Axios uses relative paths (/api/...) intercepted by the
# Vite proxy which forwards them to localhost:3000 — no CORS issues in dev.
VITE_API_URL=

# ── Production ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.your-university.edu
